expression=Completion<DerivedResult>()
initializer of `completion` must be of type Continuation<BaseResult>, found Completion<DerivedResult>; nominal application `Continuation` is invariant: first differing type argument 1 (`T`) is `DerivedResult` in `Continuation<DerivedResult>`, but `BaseResult` in `Continuation<BaseResult>`; construct the target application directly or convert explicitly
